      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Tracking the indirect impact of such subtle interventions is inherently challenging because the averted negative outcomes are invisible. To begin tracking, focus on measuring immediate shifts in the environment following your interaction, such as a change in dialogue tone or the resumption of normal activity. More broadly, you could document the frequency of these high-tension moments and note if your presence correlates with a subsequent lowering of general ambient stress in that node. This qualitative mapping can help you build a pattern of effective intervention points in the city's social landscape.",
